# Patch bodies carry the line endings of the sources they apply to (some
# upstreams, like cryptopp, ship CRLF), so keep them byte-exact: EOL
# normalization on commit would strip those CRs and break "git apply" by hand.
# Do not use "binary" here: it also unsets diff and merge, which hides patch
# contents in git diff and in the GitLab web UI.
*.patch -text
*.diff -text
